        "created_at": "2015-02-20T21:09:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi!</p><p>I have only recently been exposed to Galactic Strike Force due to being involved with a local convention where I will be running a demo of the game for the convention members.&nbsp; For the most part, I am enjoying what I have seen and read through of the game.&nbsp; That stated, I feel like I keep missing some basic explinations of things that I could really use some assistance to understand.</p><p>Specifically, information on mission cards and how they enter play seems to be rather lacking in eveything I have been reading.&nbsp; Is there a general rule or example that might be available that best describes when a mission should be brought into play?</p><p>Is the intention to always have only one mission in play at a time?</p><p>Can there ever be more then one mission in play at a time?</p><p>Is it usually up to the players to determine which sector the mission is added to, if the card does not state where to place it?</p><p>Thank you VERY much for your time on this!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:52.255Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
